  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Constrict, engulf, swallow whole, troop attack, or swarm attack; any one strike talent.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use a strike talent as a standard action, you may do so in conjunction with a troop attack or swarm attack in place of a weapon attack. Only a single target is affected by the sphere effect and they are allowed a Reflex save to negate the sphere effect. Alternatively, you may spend a standard action to apply the effects of one sphere effect you could deliver through a strike to the next instance of constrict, engulf or swallow whole damage you deal to a single target.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc99\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
